"P1824415609" "John Houston"
// DetailString :
"P3380191401" "The most annoying television producer of the last decade. John Houston has a 'can do' attitude that makes the most motivated person want to puke. He talks as fast as Neuron but lacks the common sense to ever shut his mouth. He is always trying to 'sell you' on whatever idea floated through his mind at that moment, and won't let you get a word in edgewise to voice an opinion.<br><br>This is the man organizing this TPN exclusive story. So much for catching the Resistance by surprise."

