// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3544847820" "Stolen Data"
// DetailString :
"P1149505564" "You took down the data courier, an unscrupulous individual named Blueshift, but the data will have to be electronically removed from his cranial data storage device. But that's a job for Lodestone Technology techs."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2981894934" "Syndicate agents in league with terrorists are in the process of raiding Lodestone Labs. This lab contains sensitive material that must not be allowed to fall into their hands. We need you to stop them."
// SendOffString :
"P4273329446" "We are not sure whether the Syndicate are aware of what is in Lodestone's archives, but if they find the data then it will not take them long to realize how important it is.<br><br>We are going to be very clear on this. Do not let them escape with this information. No matter the cost, this data must be recovered... or destroyed!"

